                // So rule: if current_folder starts with source_rel + "/" or equals source_rel, after move, set current_folder to "" (or maybe to new location? But observed they set to "").

                // Let's implement: if current_folder == source_rel or current_folder.starts_with(&format!("{}/", source_rel)), then reset current_folder to "".

